ng period."},{"excerpt":"koelde Webb eerst wekenlang af","claim":"Webb and its instruments took several weeks to cool to stable temperatures, early in the commissioning timeline.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"The telescope and scientific instruments started to cool rapidly in the shade of the sunshield, but it took several weeks for them to cool all the way down and reach stable temperatures.","narrative":"weken van afkoeling","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source says cooling began in the first month and took several weeks to reach stable temperatures.","materiality":"Accurately describes an early commissioning step."},{"excerpt":"Daarna duurden de spiegeluitlijning maanden","claim":"Mirror alignment took place over several months after the initial cooling period.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"In the second, third and fourth months: Initial optics checkouts, and telescope alignment.","narrative":"maanden van spiegeluitlijning","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source places telescope alignment in months two through four, after describing first-month cooldown.","materiality":"Establishes that deployment was followed by extended optical alignment."},{"excerpt":"gevolgd door de kalibratie van de instrumenten","claim":"Instrument calibration followed the main mirror-alignment period.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"In the fifth and sixth months: Calibration and completion of commissioning.","narrative":"vervolgens instrumentkalibratie","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source places instrument calibration in months five and six, after alignment in months two through four.","materiality":"Preserves the commissioning sequence."},{"excerpt":"Pas na die ingebruikname begon de telescoop aan routinewetenschap.","claim":"Webb began routine science only after commissioning was complete.","categor